From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:17:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Overgrowth: add KernelSU-Next (legacy, syscall-table
 hook)

KernelSU-Next legacy b933b1f (v3.4.0-legacy), version pinned to 33318.
Uses the syscall table hook, so no manual source hooks or kprobes.
Enable with vendor/samsung/overgrowth-ksu.config.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KfdEw7FqSm92uoQmEa9GaX
